    "reason": "[ev-5e95ef039bdc] is a single changelog line saying Argo CD now supports kustomize's --include-templates for labels. It is a new opt-in capability, and the line does not say how an environment turns it on. The proposed exposure checks only whether Argo CD itself is at version 3.0.0 or later. That would flag every environment upgrading to this release, which is broader than the opt-in users and is not a condition about the subject. The evidence and section context don't name the setting that enables the feature ([ev-5e95ef039bdc] is the only mention), so no corrected condition follows.",
